3. Original to Dux Icons (MIT)

  src/own/places/folder.svg, and the folder silhouette and front panel that
  every typed folder reuses; the folded corner of the document sheet; the
  sun in the pictures mark; the capital A in
  src/own/mimetypes/font-x-generic.svg.

4. The Dux logo (Dux Labs)

  src/own/apps/dev.duxlabs.shell.svg is the Dux bird, the logo of the Dux
  Labs projects, scaled onto the grid from dux.svg of the Dux documentation
  site. It stands for DMS and is not a mark of Dux Icons to reuse elsewhere.

Each mark lives in its own file so any of them can be replaced on its own.

App glyphs
----------

The one-color app glyphs drawn by the Themed and Monochrome app icon styles
are original to Dux Icons (MIT):

  src/art/symbolic/dev.duxlabs.*-symbolic.svg   our own apps, after their
                                                full-color art in src/art/apps
  src/mono/apps/com.mitchellh.ghostty.svg       a ghost with a shell prompt

Every other app glyph is drawn at build time from the app's own icon, or from
an icon theme installed on the machine; none is shipped.

